factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 3 problems
  The reel_script states the fire was prevented from spreading to nearby farms and that the major fire disaster was avoided, which matches the article, so no issue there; however the article says the sugarcane was 'already ready for harvest' and the draft's 'குமரேசன் தனது தோட்டத்தில் கரும்பு பயிரிட்டு வந்தார்' is acceptable, but the reel_script omits that the fire brigade was led by station in-charge officer Radhakrishnan (ராதாகிருஷ்ணன்) and that the fire station is in Karur district (கரூர் மாவட்டம்), which are not mentioned in the reel_script or slides
  The caption's 'நடவடிக்கை: புகளூர் தீயணைப்பு வீரர்கள் தீயை அணைத்தனர்' and slides attribute the firefighting to Pugalur station but the article does not state the cause of the fire, and the draft does not mention that the cause is unknown or unstated, which could imply information not in the article
  The reel_script says 'அருகிலுள்ள விவசாயத் தோட்டங்களுக்குத் தீ பரவாமல் தடுக்கப்பட்டு, பெரும் தீ விபத்து தவிர்க்கப்பட்டது' which mixes two facts into one sentence (the spread prevention and the avoidance of a major disaster) with a dangling structure that makes the sentence hard to parse clearly
